_refs\":[\"turn306047product14\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"4:5\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn306047product14\",\"Jackery Explorer 2000 v2 + 400W Solar\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$1,399.00\n\nEco Solar Kits\n\n2,042Wh battery \u00b7 2,200W output \u00b7 400W solar\n\nA lightweight option for camping and RV travel. Its 39.5 lb station is easier to move, but it lacks a dedicated 30A RV outlet.\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn306047product16\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"4:5\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn306047product16\",\"EcoFlow DELTA 3 Max + 160W Solar Panel\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$1,099.00\n\nThe Home Depot\n\n2,048Wh battery \u00b7 2,400W output \u00b7 160W solar\n\nA competitively priced bundle for running appliances, although I would prefer a larger solar array for multi-day trips.\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn306047product10\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"4:5\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n(Best for higher power needs)\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn306047product10\",\"EcoFlow DELTA 3 Ultra + 440W Solar\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$2,099.00\n\nBest Buy\n\n3,096Wh battery \u00b7 3,600W output \u00b7 440W solar\n\nBetter suited to larger RV electrical loads, with considerably more battery storage and inverter power.\n\nPrices are current search listings and may change. Verify the exact bundle contents and shipping terms before ordering.\n\n## How much solar power does your RV need?\n\n| RV usage | Battery capacity | Recommended solar panels |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| Weekend camping, lights, phones | 1,000Wh | 200\u2013400W |\n| RV fridge, fans, laptops | 2,000Wh | 400\u2013600W |\n| Extended off-grid camping | 3,000\u20134,000Wh | 600\u20131,000W |\n| Air conditioner and heavy |  |  |"}],"c":15}   

